superpowers (Kiro power)
========================

The skills vendored in this power are the original work of Jesse Vincent and the
team at Prime Radiant.

  Author:  Jesse Vincent / Prime Radiant
  Source:  https://github.com/obra/superpowers
  License: MIT (see UPSTREAM-LICENSE)

This power repackages those skills UNCHANGED so they can be installed in Kiro.
It is a redistribution (vendoring), not a fork and not original work. No skill
content has been modified. Upstream already lays skills out one level below
skills/, so no restructuring was needed; the skill directories are copied
verbatim.

Harness-specific plugin scaffolding, session hooks, evals, tests, and release
tooling from the upstream project are intentionally not included (see README).

The synced upstream commit is recorded in UPSTREAM.txt.

All credit for the skills belongs to Jesse Vincent and Prime Radiant. Please
support the original authors and consult the upstream repository as the source
of truth.
